    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Escape 9 to 5 is an hardcore climbing - parkour game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overworked and Underpaid,\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You try to escape your monotonous life and become someone better...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to ascend from the confines of your office to the limitless skies above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you lose all your progess,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO CHECKPOINTS!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO SECOND CHANCES!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO SAVING PROGRESS!</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each jump is a different challange. With practice and patience you can make it through.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through imaginative biomes each symbolizing a step away from corporate life. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area offers unique obstacles and aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports only keyboard and mouse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows only.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Escape 9 to 5 is an hardcore climbing - parkour game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Overworked and Underpaid,\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>You try to escape your monotonous life and become someone better...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game challenges you to ascend from the confines of your office to the limitless skies above.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you fall, you lose all your progess,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO CHECKPOINTS!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO SECOND CHANCES!</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>NO SAVING PROGRESS!</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each jump is a different challange. With practice and patience you can make it through.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate through imaginative biomes each symbolizing a step away from corporate life. </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every area offers unique obstacles and aesthetics.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game supports only keyboard and mouse.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Windows only.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Trapped in a monotonous job, escape by climbing your way out in to the unknown. Navigate through stress and chaos. Each jump is a different challenge and you only get one chance...",
